{
  "version": 1,
  "params": {
    "category": {
      "label": "Category",
      "type": "buttons",
      "options": [
        "Images from XBio",
        "Featured pictures",
        "London"
      ],
      "value": "Images from XBio"
    }
  },
  "widgets": [
    {
      "id": "cat-note",
      "widgetType": "markdown",
      "config": {
        "text": "## \ud83d\uddc2\ufe0f A Commons category, as a gallery\n\nA category is just another way to obtain a **file list** \u2014 so it lives inside the Commons File Gallery rather than in a widget of its own. Point it at a category and the same card that shows a pasted list shows this: *newest* and *alphabetical* come from the API, *random* and *largest* are applied here.\n\n**Subcategories are not walked** \u2014 one level only, on purpose. When a category holds more files than the card asked for, the subtitle says so \u2014 *N files \u00b7 of the category's total* \u2014 instead of quietly showing a slice. Click any image to publish it to the board.",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cat-pick",
      "widgetType": "boardControls",
      "config": {
        "title": "Pick a category",
        "show": "category",
        "refreshSeconds": 86400
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cat-alpha",
      "widgetType": "gallery",
      "config": {
      "from": "category",
        "from": "category",
        "category": "{{category}}",
        "project": "commons.wikimedia",
        "order": "alpha",
        "displayMode": "grid",
        "iconSize": "medium",
        "imageFit": "cover",
        "maxItems": 24,
        "_title": "{{category}} \u2014 alphabetical (from the API)",
        "refreshSeconds": 3600
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "cat-random",
      "widgetType": "gallery",
      "config": {
        "from": "category",
        "category": "{{category}}",
        "wiki": "commons.wikimedia",
        "order": "random",
        "displayMode": "grid",
        "iconSize": "small",
        "imageFit": "cover",
        "maxItems": 12,
        "_title": "{{category}} \u2014 random picks",
        "refreshSeconds": 1800
      }
    }
  ],
  "layout": [
    {
      "i": "cat-note",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 8,
      "h": 3,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 2
    },
    {
      "i": "cat-pick",
      "x": 8,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 4,
      "h": 3,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 2
    },
    {
      "i": "cat-alpha",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 7,
      "h": 10,
      "minW": 4,
      "minH": 3
    },
    {
      "i": "cat-random",
      "x": 7,
      "y": 3,
      "w": 5,
      "h": 8,
      "minW": 3,
      "minH": 3
    }
  ]
}
